        "Content": "Coming Soon\r\n\r\nMount Auburn Park, Killiney Hill Road, Killiney, Co. Dublin\r\n\r\nElevated Luxury Living Overlooking Dublin Bay\r\n\r\nMount Auburn Park is an exclusive luxury development in the heart of Killiney, comprising five exceptional family homes, alongside a beautifully designed three-bedroom duplex and own-door one-bedroom apartment.\r\n\r\nOccupying an elevated position on the prestigious Killiney Hill Road, many of the residences enjoy stunning sea views across Dublin Bay, creating a truly unique coastal living experience. From sunrise over the water to ever-changing panoramic vistas, Mount Auburn Park offers residents the opportunity to enjoy one of Dublin's most spectacular settings from the comfort of their own home.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by Turkington Rock, this boutique collection of just seven residences has been thoughtfully designed to combine timeless architecture, contemporary living and an unrivalled location directly opposite Killiney Hill Park. The interiors have been curated by renowned interior designer Helen Turkington, whose signature approach to elegant, timeless living spaces ensures each home delivers exceptional comfort, quality and style.\r\n\r\nEvery residence has been carefully crafted to maximise natural light, space and outlook, taking full advantage of its elevated position overlooking Dublin Bay. Premium finishes, thoughtful layouts and carefully considered detailing combine to create homes of enduring quality in one of South Dublin's most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nJust moments from Killiney Beach, Dalkey Village, excellent schools and DART services, Mount Auburn Park offers the perfect balance of coastal tranquillity and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nAvailability\r\nComing Soon - A limited collection of just seven residences in one of South Dublin's most prestigious coastal locations.\r\nPrices on Application.\r\nFeatures\r\nDevelopment Highlights\r\n• Exclusive development of just 7 luxury residences\r\n• Four no 5-bedroom, three-storey semi-detached homes extending to approx. 235 sq.m (2,500 sq.ft)\r\n• One 4-bedroom, three-storey semi-detached home extending to approx. 203 sq.m (2,105 sq.ft)\r\n• One 3-bedroom duplex extending to approx. 126 sq.m (1,360 sq.ft)\r\n• One own-door 1-bedroom apartment extending to approx. 68 sq.m (727 sq.ft)\r\n• Stunning sea views across Dublin Bay from selected homes\r\n• Interiors designed by Helen Turkington\r\n• Elevated setting opposite Killiney Hill Park\r\n• Premium specification throughout\r\n• A-rated energy-efficient homes\r\n• Landscaped communal and private outdoor spaces\r\n• Developed by Turkington Rock\r\n• Prices on Application\r\n\r\nBER Details\r\nBER: A\r\n\r\nViewing Details\r\nRegister your interest today to receive launch information, floorplans, specifications and pricing details as they become available on https://mountauburnpark.ie/"
